r: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin-top: 1rem;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n        }\n        h1{\n            margin: 2rem;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n        }\n        p{\n            font-size: 1rem;\n        }\n    <\/style>\n\n\n    <h1>THE SCIENCE OF STYLE WITH MAXIMUM COMFORT<\/h1>\n    <p>Too often, finding the perfect comfortable shoe for women comes at the expense of style, forcing you to choose between comfort and appearance. At Vionic, we’re disrupting the footwear space by transforming how people view women’s shoes - from women's walking shoes to high heels to slippers and everything in between.<\/p>\n    <div id=\"moreText\">\n        <h1>COMFORTABLE SHOES FOR WOMEN, NO MATTER THE OCCASION<\/h1>\n        <p>Finding comfortable shoes for women should not be difficult, whether you’re looking for a fancy pair of shoes for the office or something more casual for your weekend outfits. We offer professional and comfortable work shoes for women that transition elegantly from the boardroom to your favorite evening restaurant, while our chic, yet comfortable flats are as well-suited running errands as they are for a night out with friends. Our everyday sneakers provide high arch support for active all-day wear, our women's casual sneakers are perfect for a chill weekend, and our comfortable sandals and flip flops are designed with the most on-trend silhouettes and color palettes of the season. We even recommend our comfortable shoes for nurses and doctors that are on their feet all day to minimize foot pain caused by over-pronation and ensure maximum comfort throughout the day.<\/p>\n        <p>The days of uncomfortable women’s shoes are over. From stylish walking shoes in a variety of colors to ballet flats and ankle boots, be stylish and feel confident in the Vionic selection of supportive on-trend shoes. Why settle for anything less? Women looking for shoes for plantar fasciitis and heel pain relief or who suffer from arch support problems will especially appreciate the orthotic support that Vionic shoes have built right into the sole. Shop comfortable shoes for women from Vionic.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <button id=\"readMoreBtn\" onclick=\"toggleText()\">Read More<\/button>\n\n    <script>\n        function toggleText() {\n            const moreText = document.getElementById(\"moreText\");\n            const btn = document.getElementById(\"readMoreBtn\");\n\n            if (moreText.style.display === \"none\") {\n                moreText.style.display = \"block\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read Less\";\n            } else {\n                moreText.style.display = \"none\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read More\";\n            }\n        }\n    <\/script>\n\n<\/body>","setwidth":"full","padding":false,"col_center":false,"bgsection":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","rangebg":0,"bgbefore":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","e_size":"auto","e_repeat":"no-repeat"}},"advanced_content_mhXJJx":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"html_hAQp8F":{"type":"html","settings":{"code":"<body>\n\n\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Footer<\/title>\n    <style>\n        \/* Main footer styling *\/\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #333;\n            color: #fff;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section {\n            flex: 1;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section h2 {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section p {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            margin: 5px 0;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section a 